WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.814
If your knitting gets interrupted for some
reason and the tension

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.360
on the tension spring is released.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.934
As you begin the row,
grab the working yarn and gently add

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.880
some tension for the first few stitches.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:24.080
Now, if there's a lot of extra slack,
milk the cow by pulling down on the yarn

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.880
behind the tension dial on the mast.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.694
This will replace the tension
on the tension spring and you

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.080
can get back to knitting.

